	(text "MIDI (TS, JP1 open: 1-2 protected, 2-3 direct) and GATE (threshold 2.2 V):\nNPN inverters on +5V; firmware sets PORT_INVEN on PB3 / PB2."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 111.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "00c15ab0-e17f-529a-ac89-9c58b24ac4a8")
	)
	(text "BIG MODULAR LADDER - S3 schematic: analog version of the modules/16bit polysynth ladder filter. Circuit intent and numbers: docs/research.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "034f7121-8461-5f2e-903d-180e9d85b0cb")
	)
	(text "ENVELOPE: ATtiny1616 at 5 V, AR envelope (ENV TIME) x DEPTH on the PA6 DAC (0..4.35 V) -> U4A -> ENV_BUF;\nthe undepthed envelope on the PB0 PWM (2 x 340 Hz RC) -> U3 NC1 -> VCA_ENV.\nCV BYPASS: J3 patched (PA3 high) -> DAC = CV (PA2) x DEPTH; U3 COM1 = CV 0..5 V scaled to 0..4.35 V.\nREC (PC2) + LED (PC3): 4-bar ENV TIME / DEPTH recorder on MIDI clock (modules/acid CvRecorder)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 120.65 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "3b0d618e-d901-547f-8916-cdd66bd00aac")
	)
	(text "Signal nets are wired; supplies use power symbols. LB0..LB4 (ladder base bias), ENV_BUF (envelope x DEPTH) and VCA_ENV (VCA envelope / CV) are joined by their net labels."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 21.59 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "45b3edaa-b0a4-5dea-b2ad-a70c8ec0348b")
	)
	(text "AUDIO IN: U5B x -1. LADDER: 200k / 1k into the driver (+/-25 mV); 4 rungs, 47n NP0;\nbias chain LB0..LB4 1.5 V steps."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 279.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "4f4f536c-c416-5c17-b7c5-30657bfcde25")
	)
	(text "RESONANCE: U11B x -1.42 (LAD_DIF - 0.05 x IN) -> C20 -> vactrol LDR -> feedback base (1k):\nk = 14.3 x 1k / (1k + R_LDR); dry level kept at any k = the 16bit (1 + k) makeup.\nRES knob + RES CV -> RES_X (passive mix, no CV attenuator) -> U7B: I_LED = RES_X / 330R."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 243.84 228.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "8b422f50-793b-50bb-b042-0154e8e17a58")
	)
	(text "POWER: +12V -> D1 -> +12V_F (op amps, ladder, U1 HT7550-1 -> +5V); -12V -> D2 -> -12V_F."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 358.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "8b77fe33-bc7d-5ed7-a35c-f3d5ba15dc6f")
	)
	(text "SUPPLY PINS + DECOUPLING"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 213.36 350.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "935f1504-7cba-5693-8074-eea2b7d88ea7")
	)
	(text "OUTPUT: U6 followers on the top nodes, U7A x10 difference amp (LAD_DIF = 0.05 x IN),\nU9A AC coupled x20.6 -> 1k -> FILTER OUT (IN x 1.03, in phase)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 243.84 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "9a9d430f-75d9-5219-b2f5-f24a71dd7bd7")
	)
	(text "VACTROL VCA (Bread Modular V2CA + LOW/SVF driver): I_LED = VCA_ENV / (470R + CURVE);\nLDR in series with R49 into U11A: VCA OUT = -FILTER x 10k / (10k + R_LDR)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 391.16 35.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "b9991faf-a7a2-5645-b531-e8ccd4ab6e22")
	)
	(text "CUTOFF + DEPTH summer -> 1/40 divider -> expo (Q3A reference at 0.55 mA, Q3B = ladder tail).\nD6 clamps V_S at -0.6 V (~31 kHz)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 294.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ed0dd3f9-36f1-546f-a204-d46016edd387")
	)
