		(property "Note" "5 V. Firmware (to be written): MIDI note on/off or GATE -> AR envelope, ENV TIME 5 ms..2 s exponential (attack = release, as the 16bit PolyFilter). DAC (VREF 4.34 V, code dithering on slow sweeps) = envelope x DEPTH, or the PA2 CV x DEPTH when PA3 sees a CV cable; PB0 PWM = the envelope for the VCA. REC (PC2) + LED (PC3): 4-bar ENV TIME / DEPTH motion recorder on MIDI clock (opt/attiny1616-tools/lib/CvRecorder, as modules/acid)"
